WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.973 --> 00:00:17.622
Gildong landed in the yard at Lord Hong's house.

2
00:00:20.144 --> 00:00:21.265
Inhyun screamed.

3
00:00:25.447 --> 00:00:26.608
hurt me, Gildong!

4
00:00:27.349 --> 00:00:29.150
I know all about your powers."

5
00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:33.161
"I'm not here to hurt you," Gildong said.

6
00:00:33.181 --> 00:00:35.102
"I'm here to see Lord Hong."

7
00:00:36.864 --> 00:00:38.045
Inhyun scowled.

8
00:00:38.065 --> 00:00:41.027
"He's sick and in trouble because of you.

9
00:00:42.088 --> 00:00:42.969
You're evil."

10
00:00:42.989 --> 00:00:45.311
"I'm not evil.

11
00:00:46.132 --> 00:00:49.094
The Hwalbindang are helping people," Gildong said.

12
00:00:49.114 --> 00:00:51.516
"You're lying!"

13
00:00:51.536 --> 00:00:53.698
Inhyun waved his arms.

14
00:00:53.718 --> 00:00:54.779
"Chief Heup!

15
00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:56.020
Gildong is here!"

16
00:00:57.601 --> 00:00:59.923
Heup rushed into the yard with two men.

17
00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:06.362
They held out spears and ran toward Gildong and Inhyun.

18
00:01:10.985 --> 00:01:17.429
gust!" Gildong swung his fan and a heavy wind blew, swirling dust everywhere.

19
00:01:18.549 --> 00:01:21.631
The men fell down, and their weapons blew away.

20
00:01:21.651 --> 00:01:25.053
"Get up and capture him!"

21
00:01:25.533 --> 00:01:26.354
Heup shouted.

22
00:01:28.835 --> 00:01:33.497
As the dust cleared, Heup's men charged toward Gildong and Inhyun again.

23
00:01:35.157 --> 00:01:36.698
Gildong held his fan.

24
00:01:36.718 --> 00:01:44.860
"Switch!" Inhyun backed toward the wall while Gildong froze.

25
00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:49.021
The men tackled Gildong and held him down.

26
00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:52.742
Heup smiled.

27
00:01:52.762 --> 00:01:55.043
"Got you, Gildong!"

28
00:01:56.823 --> 00:01:59.084
Suddenly there was a scream at the gate.

29
00:02:00.688 --> 00:02:02.609
"Let my son go!"

30
00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:04.289
Lady Yoo shouted.

31
00:02:05.169 --> 00:02:07.370
Heup looked again at the boy on the ground.

32
00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:11.151
It wasn't Gildong—it was Inhyun.

33
00:02:12.431 --> 00:02:13.492
Heup groaned.

34
00:02:19.753 --> 00:02:20.393
got away!"

35
00:02:24.234 --> 00:02:27.595
Gildong tried to think of another plan for helping his father.

36
00:02:28.395 --> 00:02:29.956
But then he heard more news.

37
00:02:31.552 --> 00:02:34.153
The king had sent Lord Hong to prison.

38
00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:40.217
One night Gildong looked up at the moon.

39
00:02:40.237 --> 00:02:44.679
"I have to free Lord Hong," he thought.

40
00:02:44.699 --> 00:02:48.581
"If I fail, the king will find a worse punishment for him.

41
00:02:49.442 --> 00:02:51.503
But how can I free him without getting captured?"

42
00:02:54.684 --> 00:02:57.546
The next morning he saw Soonhee and Boknam.

43
00:02:59.047 --> 00:03:01.068
They were playing with dolls made of straw.

44
00:03:02.688 --> 00:03:04.189
Boknam held up a doll.

45
00:03:04.209 --> 00:03:06.611
"I am Hong Gildong!"

46
00:03:06.631 --> 00:03:09.633
"Four of you go north!"

47
00:03:10.133 --> 00:03:10.894
Soonhee said.

48
00:03:10.914 --> 00:03:13.156
"Three of you go south!

49
00:03:14.016 --> 00:03:15.657
Punish bad people!"

50
00:03:17.098 --> 00:03:18.660
She waved the dolls around.

51
00:03:20.941 --> 00:03:22.422
Gildong looked at the dolls.

52
00:03:22.442 --> 00:03:24.404
"That's it!"

53
00:03:28.286 --> 00:03:30.208
Gildong arrived at the palace gate.

54
00:03:32.392 --> 00:03:35.193
"I am Hong Gildong, leader of the Hwalbindang."

55
00:03:36.614 --> 00:03:38.595
The guards pointed their spears at him.

56
00:03:39.695 --> 00:03:41.376
Gildong raised his hands.

57
00:03:41.396 --> 00:03:43.497
"I am here to surrender."

58
00:03:45.297 --> 00:03:46.738
The gate captain grinned.

59
00:03:46.758 --> 00:03:49.019
"I have Gildong!

60
00:03:49.799 --> 00:03:51.420
The king will be so pleased!"

61
00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.441
He rushed into the palace.

62
00:03:59.803 --> 00:04:01.984
The king was meeting with the police chief.

63
00:04:03.156 --> 00:04:04.237
The captain bowed.

64
00:04:04.257 --> 00:04:09.199
"Your Majesty, Hong Gildong has surrendered at the gate!"

65
00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:14.742
is playing tricks on us again!"

66
00:04:15.343 --> 00:04:16.243
the king cried.

67
00:04:19.845 --> 00:04:21.626
many is that now, Chief Heup?"

68
00:04:21.646 --> 00:04:25.148
"That makes seven, sir."

69
00:04:26.869 --> 00:04:27.849
Heup groaned.

70
00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:32.051
"So far seven Gildongs have surrendered!"
